    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d727">

                <pb facs="0723" n="711" xml:id="pg711"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.00 Statement July 16, 1937/25: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Davies</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-07-24T14:00:00-04:00">July 24, 1937—2 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>110. Your 188, July 23, 8 p.m. My plan has been to get the maximum beneficial
                    effect by assembling replies from all governments and publishing them en bloc. I
                    should thus prefer to defer publication and arrange with Moscow for a later
                    simultaneous release, although I do not feel I can insist thereon.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
